  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core contribution  to ATAF&apos;s budget to support its delivery of outputs (which are identified annually in ATAF&apos;s workplan ) which help African countries to improve their tax systems</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Core contribution  to ATAF&apos;s budget to support its delivery of outputs (which are identified annually in ATAF&apos;s workplan ) which help African countries to improve their tax systems is a component of support to the African Tax Administation Forum reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xA3;250,000. This project benefits Africa, regional. It works in the following sector(s): Domestic revenue mobilisation.</narrative>
  </description>
